---
layout: base.njk
title: Manga
---

<h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold">manga</h2>
<p class="mb-6">
  Archive for Yearly Shonen Jump, as well as my thoughts about the state of the industry
</p>

<h3 class="mb-3 font-bold">manga posts</h3>
{% if collections.manga.length %}
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    {% for post in collections.manga | reverse %}
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <time class="shrink-0 text-stone-500" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | isoDate }}</time>
        <a class="underline hover:text-red-600" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <p class="text-stone-500">nothing here yet.</p>
{% endif %}